  "entity": "HCMv3.GovtRelationsManagement.Sponsor",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>A sponsor: a licensed company or owner that employees are sponsored under for residence and work permits. Employees are linked to a sponsor on their Employee Sponsors records, and the sponsor's name then appears on employee and payroll reports. Its licences, signatories, representatives, bank accounts and job-title quotas are kept on the related screens.</p>",
